# Obsidian Charmaw costs {1} less per opponent land that could produce {C}
# (canProduceManaColor, CardProperty.java:804-811). Fiery Islet's
# "Produced$ Combo U R" holds a C only in the word Combo, which
# AbilityManaPart strips first (:644-684), so only Wastes counts: one less,
# not two. L2: same as Java.
startturn human
advance 3
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets 56
tapformana human 100 R
tapformana human 101 R
tapformana human 102 R
tapformana human 103 R
castspell human 1
resolvestack
resolvestack
